#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/copy.rst:5
msgid "Copy part"
msgstr "复制部件"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/copy.rst:7
msgid ""
"QElectroTech element editor allows copying the different possible type of "
"`parts`_ to paste them later on at different place from the element editor "
"workspace."
msgstr "QElectroTech 元件编辑器允许复制各种类型的 `部件 <parts_>`_ ，以便稍后粘贴到元件编辑器工作区中的其他位置。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/copy.rst:12
msgid ""
"Multiples `parts`_ can be copied at the same time, pressing ``Ctrl`` is "
"necessary to select more than one `part`_."
msgstr "可以同时复制多个 `部件 <parts_>`_ ；要选择多个 `部件 <part_>`_ ，需要按住 ``Ctrl`` 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/copy.rst:16
msgid ""
"Copying parts can be done from `menu bar`_, by right click on the `part`_ "
"and using the corresponding keyboard shortcut."
msgstr "可以通过 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_、右键点击 `部件 <part_>`_ 或相应的快捷键来复制部件。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/copy.rst:20
msgid "Copy part from menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏复制部件"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/copy.rst:22
#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/copy.rst:46
msgid "Select the `part`_ which should be copied."
msgstr "选择要复制的 `部件 <part_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/copy.rst:23
msgid "Select **Edit > Copy** menu item to copy the `part`_."
msgstr "选择 **编辑 > 复制** 菜单项以复制 `部件 <part_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/copy.rst:28
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech element editor Edit menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 元件编辑器“编辑”菜单"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/copy.rst:31
msgid "Copy part by right click"
msgstr "通过右键复制部件"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/copy.rst:33
msgid "Right click on the `part`_ which should be copied."
msgstr "右键点击要复制的 `部件 <part_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/copy.rst:34
msgid "Select the option **Copy** to copy the `part`_."
msgstr "选择 **复制** 选项以复制 `部件 <part_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/copy.rst:39
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech right click PopUp window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 右键弹出窗口"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/copy.rst:42
msgid "Copy part using keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "使用快捷键复制部件"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/copy.rst:44
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows using keyboard shortcut to increase the working "
"efficiency."
msgstr "QElectroTech 支持使用快捷键来提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/copy.rst:47
msgid "Press ``Ctrl + c`` to copy the `part`_."
msgstr "按 ``Ctrl + c`` 复制 `部件 <part_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/copy.rst:51
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech keyboard shortcut, refer to `menu "
"bar`_ section."
msgstr "有关 QElectroTech 快捷键的更多信息，请参见 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 一节。"
